  "description": {
   "en": "No one could understand me. That's why I turned to crime.\n\nA morbid curiosity for violence and death escalated from insects to animals and then to humans. This dark curiosity that drives a friend into a corner through an anonymous underground website. A sisterly love that is warped by longing for a beloved older sister and the awakening of one's ego. Unable to express feelings for a mother. A secret that two lonely children cannot tell anyone...\nFive shocking child criminal horror stories with beautiful illustrations that will pierce your heart!"
  },
